I1
sVWe collect and use non-personal information (Analytical Data) during the use of our apps:
p11
I1
sVAshes2 Studio does not knowingly collect any personal information from children below the aforementioned age and if Ashes2 Studio learns that Ashes2 Studio has inadvertently gathered personal data from children under the aforementioned age, Ashes2 Studio will take reasonable measures to promptly erase such personal data from Ashes2 Studio's records.
p12
I2
sVAshes2 Studio also stores your game checkins, likes, dislikes, recommendations and messages.
p13
I1
sVAdditionally, Ashes2 Studio may disclose personal data to its parent companies and its subsidiaries in accordance with this Privacy Policy.
p14
I1
sVAshes2 Studio may also disclose your personal data to third parties when Ashes2 Studio has a reason to believe that a disclosure is necessary to address potential or actual injury or interference with Ashes2 Studio's rights, property, operations, users or others who may be harmed or may suffer loss or damage, or Ashes2 Studio believes that such disclosure is necessary to protect Ashes2 Studio's rights, combat fraud and/or comply with a judicial proceeding, court order, or legal process served on Ashes2 Studio.
p15
I1
sVAshes2 Studio may disclose your personal data to third parties as required by law enforcement or other government officials in connection with an investigation of fraud, intellectual property infringements, or other activity that is illegal or may expose you or Ashes2 Studio to legal liability.
